From 35cb62956f7c44324bfeca8a584602efa00a61be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kamran Karimli <kamranka@azerconnect.az>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:07:53 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Plan v2 Phase 2: focused exam mode, Azerbaijani PDF
 fonts, Onest display
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Exam mode (plan 5.1)
- Candidate workspace moved into a route group with the navigation shell;
  the assessment, its pre-start screen and the submitted page sit outside it
- One header with title, autosave status, the progress chain (answered,
  current, flagged; click to jump) and the single timer (amber under 5 min)
- Flags, 680px reading column, 20px questions, 64px answer cards with A-D nodes
- Review grid before a single Submit assessment; cream canvas in light mode
- Second timer removed; AssessmentTimer component deleted
- Countdown waits for the saved draft, so an expired reopen submits the
  candidate's answers, never an empty paper

PDF and type
- Report PDF draws Azerbaijani and Cyrillic: Inter (body) and Onest (headings)
  embedded as subset data URLs (src/lib/pdf-fonts.ts), replacing Helvetica
- Manrope has no capital Ə, so display text uses Onest (plan 4.2 fallback)

Brand and exports
- Excel headers use the brand navy; exports named vantage-*.xlsx
- README and OpenAPI title renamed to Vantage

Lint: remove unused imports and variables.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VwbNAvHSSauSWXKNV6DNV9
